%!PS
% Poster: 22
% Lobby signage: a screen that cycles through a playlist of scenes, for ever.
% The scenes (welcome, today's events, a clock and countdown, the weather, a status
% board, and a lunch menu that is on the list only at lunchtime) are component files
% beside this one; what plays, in what order and when is in lobby.playlist. This file
% only places the playlist. Portrait: `--param Portrait=1`. A different moment of the
% week, for the schedule and the clock: `--param Day=wed --param Time=12:15`.
%
% The playlist's time of day comes from here, from `param`, never the wall clock:
% a host that shows this live passes the real time when it starts the movie.

/Portrait 0 param 1 eq /tall exch def
/Day /tue param /day exch def                      % /mon .. /sun
/Time (10:02:00) param /time exch def              % hours, or (H:MM[:SS])

/lobby (lobby.playlist) <<
  /Size tall { [720 1280] } { [1280 720] } ifelse
  /Safe 0.05                                       % a TV that crops: keep 5% of each edge clear
  /Day day /Time time
  /Background [0.035 0.05 0.085]
>> playlist

<< /Size tall { [720 1280] } { [1280 720] } ifelse
   /Duration /lobby playlistduration  /Loop true  /FPS 30
   /Title (Lobby Signage)
   /Description (A lobby screen cycling through a playlist: welcome, today's events, a big clock and countdown, the weather and a status board, with a lunch menu that appears only at lunchtime. It loops for ever.)
>> animation

/scene { /lobby << >> place } def
